#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:51
msgid "Audiovisual Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:52
msgid "Compare collected recordings by source, country, duration and publication year, and see which catalogue fields are available."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:66
msgid "Loading audiovisual overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:72
msgid "Collection Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:73
msgid "Explore the collection by date, country, language, document type and source, with views of catalogue growth and frequently indexed entries."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:79
msgid "Compare Newspapers"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:80
msgid "Compare two selections of newspaper articles or Islamic periodical issues by publication year, catalogue tags, vocabulary and available AI ratings. Choose a country or a single publication for each selection."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:98
msgid "Loading newspaper comparison"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:104
msgid "Distinctive Vocabulary"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:105
msgid "Find words used at higher relative rates in one country or decade than in the remaining newspaper articles. A second view identifies periods of increased use of subject tags. Statistical thresholds are explained alongside the charts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:118
msgid "Loading distinctive vocabulary"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:124
msgid "Entity Networks"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:125
msgid "Explore links between people, organisations, places, subjects and events recorded on the same items. Shared records indicate catalogue associations, which require interpretation through the sources."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:137
msgid "Loading entity networks"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:143
msgid "Index Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:144
msgid "Explore the catalogue index and the use of subject and place tags over time. Counts describe recorded associations rather than word occurrences in the original texts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:159
msgid "Loading index overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:165
msgid "Laïcité"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:166
msgid "Explore a dossier selected through the Laïcité subject tag and a vocabulary of laïcité and secularism. Compare source types, terms in context, associated entries and AI ratings. Searches include titles, available full text and descriptive fields; readable extracts follow each field’s public status."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:202
msgid "Loading laïcité dossier"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:209
msgid "Press Language"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:210
msgid "Compare estimated reading ease, vocabulary diversity and article length over time and by newspaper. Measures use extracted text; the charts explain the scores and their limitations."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:220
msgid "Loading press language metrics"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:226
msgid "On This Day"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:227
msgid "Show articles and periodical issues published on today’s date in earlier years. Switch between Gregorian and converted Islamic-calendar dates, and between list, decade and clipping layouts. Only records with suitable dates can appear."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:233
msgid "Islamic Organisations Co-occurrence"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:234
msgid "Compare pairs of words found near the names of selected Islamic organisations in newspaper articles. Darker cells indicate pairs found together in more articles."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:245
msgid "Loading organisation co-occurrences"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:251
msgid "Periodicals Semantic Landscape"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:252
msgid "Explore Islamic periodical issues arranged by an AI comparison of their tables of contents. Nearby points suggest issues to compare; positions and distances are approximate."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:265 src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:392
msgid "Loading semantic landscape"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:271
msgid "Periodicals Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:272
msgid "Explore Islamic periodical holdings by year, publication, country, language and catalogue subject, with vocabulary and statistically modelled themes. Gaps in the collection do not establish gaps in publication."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:284
msgid "Loading periodicals overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:290
msgid "Press Bylines"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:291
msgid "Explore recorded journalists and press agencies, the share of articles with a byline, and their representation over time. A missing byline may reflect incomplete cataloguing."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:302
msgid "Loading press bylines"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:308
msgid "Press Reprints"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:309
msgid "Find articles from different newspapers with highly similar AI text representations. These candidate pairs may indicate shared dispatches, communiqués or reprints; read both articles before concluding that copying occurred."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:321
msgid "Loading press reprints"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:327
msgid "References Overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:328
msgid "Explore the bibliography by publication date, type, language, associated country, author and subject. Additional views show authorship links, available full text, modelled themes and text similarity."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:341
msgid "Loading references overview"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:347
msgid "Scary Terms"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:348
msgid "Explore selected vocabulary associated with radicalism and extremism in newspaper articles: occurrences, trends, countries, term pairs, surrounding vocabulary and tagged places. Counts describe language use, not the extremism of the people discussed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:371
msgid "Loading scary terms"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:378
msgid "Semantic Landscape"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:379
msgid "Explore newspaper articles arranged by an AI comparison of their full texts, with colours for country, decade or modelled topic. Nearby points suggest texts to compare; distances are approximate."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:398
msgid "Sentiment Atlas"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:399
msgid "Compare AI assessments of tone towards Islam and Muslims, their prominence in articles, and subjectivity. Views show changes over time, differences between sources and model agreement. Ratings require checking against the texts, especially for subjectivity."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:410
msgid "Loading sentiment atlas"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:416
msgid "Spatial Exploration"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:417
msgid "Map places linked through catalogue records, with filters for countries and associated people, organisations, subjects or events. Only places with coordinates appear; the map does not include every location mentioned in the texts."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:428
msgid "Loading spatial exploration"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:434
msgid "Term Trends"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:435
msgid "Compare the number or share of dated newspaper articles containing selected words. Search the frequent-word vocabulary and compare up to eight terms. Each word counts once per article, and only articles with usable processed text enter the calculation."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:446
msgid "Loading term trends"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:452
msgid "Topic Explorer"
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:453
msgid "Explore 30 themes identified in newspaper articles by a statistical topic model. Select a theme to examine its publication dates, countries, newspapers and example articles. Modelled themes differ from catalogue subject tags."
msgstr ""

#: src/Site/BlockRegistry.php:474
msgid "Loading Topic Explorer"
msgstr ""

